    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DocumentItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#GuidanceSignInstallationCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>유도표지 설치 비용</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>피난구 또는 통로에 유도표지를 설치하는 작업에 소요되는 비용.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>LLM_document_proposal</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ExitGuidanceInstallationCostItem"/>
    <tbox:evidence>[{"source_id": "STD:009", "quote": "유도표지 설치 피난구 또는 통로에 유도표지를 설치하는 작업."}]</tbox:evidence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ExitGuidanceMaterialCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>유도등 자재 비용항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>유도등 자재의 공급·구매에 대한 비용대상. 자재 자체나 설치 작업 비용은 아니다.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>researcher_cost_role_bridge</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#CostItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ProgressPaymentRound">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>기성회차</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>기성 산정과 청구의 시간 단위</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ProgressPaymentItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>기성내역항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>공사기성부분내역서에서 전회·금회·누계·잔여 수량과 금액을 산정하는 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DetailItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#AudienceLightInstallationCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>객석유도등 설치 비용</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>객석의 통로·바닥 또는 벽에 유도등을 설치하는 작업에 소요되는 비용.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>LLM_document_proposal</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ExitGuidanceInstallationCostItem"/>
    <tbox:evidence>[{"source_id": "STD:008", "quote": "객석유도등 설치 객석의 통로·바닥 또는 벽에 유도등을 설치하는 작업."}]</tbox:evidence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ExitGuidanceInstallationCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>유도등 설치 비용항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>유도등 설치 시공 작업에 대한 비용대상. 작업 활동 자체나 자재 공급 비용은 아니다.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>researcher_cost_role_bridge</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#CostItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ProgressPaymentSummaryItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>기성집계항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>기성금액항목의 금회금액을 공종별로 합산한 공사기성부분내역서 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#SummaryItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#OutputDocument">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>산출서류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>근거서류의 정보를 사용해 기성금액 산정 결과를 제시하는 서류</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ProgressDocument"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#WorkCategorySummaryStatement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
