    <rdfs:comment>공종별 상세 비용을 합산해 제시하는 근거서류</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#EvidenceDocument"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ContractStatement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>계약내역서</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>확정된 계약수량·계약단가·계약금액을 제공하는 근거서류</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#EvidenceDocument"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#exit_guidanceMethodText">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#CostItem"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label>유도등 시공방법 표현</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>원본 품명/규격에 명시된 유도등 시공방법 표현. 단위나 수치의 추정 변환 없이 보존한다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#CostCalculationItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>원가계산항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>원가계산서에서 비용 산정 근거를 제공하는 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DetailItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#EvacuationLightMountingCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>피난구유도등 부착 비용</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>피난구유도등을 출입구에 인접한 규정 높이에 부착하는 작업에 소요되는 비용.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>LLM_document_proposal</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ExitGuidanceInstallationCostItem"/>
    <tbox:evidence>[{"source_id": "STD:003", "quote": "피난구유도등 부착 출입구에 인접한 규정 높이에 피난구유도등을 부착하는 작업."}]</tbox:evidence>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#ContractItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>계약항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>계약수량·계약단가·계약금액을 제공하는 계약내역서 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DetailItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DocumentItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
