    <rdfs:comment>기성서류에 포함되는 비용정보의 의미 단위</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#CalculatedQuantityItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>수량산출항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>수량산출서에서 계약수량의 근거가 되는 산출수량 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/fire_exit_guidance#DetailItem"/>
